summary: Use crash utility to analyse the vmcore dumped from kpatched kernel
description: |+
    It uses crash commands to analyse vmcore dumped from a kpatched kernel.

    Parameter:

    KPATCH_TARGET_FUNCTION:
        Allow passing a list of functions being patched. Functions need to be separated by a space.



contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
component:
  - crash
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - crash
recommend:
  - kernel-debuginfo
duration: 300m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/analyse-crash-kpatch-cmd
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/analyse-crash-kpatch-cmd
